PumpkinHead	This is a pumpkin.
MoonCake1	The Icy Mooncake Portions are made according to a mysterious Chinese recipe and can be manufactured as a whole Icy Mooncake. When you put 6 <Mooncake Portions> onto the Compound Interface (shortcut key:D), they can be compounded into a whole <Mooncake>. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
MoonCake2	The Fruit Mooncake Portions are made according to a mysterious Chinese recipe and can be manufactured as a whole Icy Mooncake. When you put 6 <Mooncake Portions> onto the Compound Interface (shortcut key:D), they can be compounded into a whole <Mooncake>. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
MoonCake3	The Tea Mooncake Portions are made according to a mysterious Chinese recipe and can be manufactured as a whole Icy Mooncake. When you put 6 <Mooncake Portions> onto the Compound Interface (shortcut key:D), they can be compounded into a whole <Mooncake>. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
MoonCake4	The Crystal Mooncake Portions are made according to a mysterious Chinese recipe and can be manufactured as a whole Icy Mooncake. When you put 6 <Mooncake Portions> onto the Compound Interface (shortcut key:D), they can be compounded into a whole <Mooncake>. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
MoonCake5	The Bean Mooncake Portions are made according to a mysterious Chinese recipe and can be manufactured as a whole Icy Mooncake. When you put 6 <Mooncake Portions> onto the Compound Interface (shortcut key:D), they can be compounded into a whole <Mooncake>. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
MoonCake6	The Red Mooncake Portions are made according to a mysterious Chinese recipe and can be manufactured as a whole Icy Mooncake. When you put 6 <Mooncake Portions> onto the Compound Interface (shortcut key:D), they can be compounded into a whole <Mooncake>. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
MoonCake7	Delicious and special Icy Mooncake which can increase EXP by 30%,  must be used within 8 hours. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
MoonCake8	Delicious and special Fruit Mooncake which can increase EXP by 60%, must be used within 2 hours. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
MoonCake9	Delicious and special Tea Mooncake which can increase EXP by 60%, must be used within 1 hour. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
MoonCake10	Delicious and special Bean Mooncake which can increase EXP by 100%,  must be used within 1 hour. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
MoonCake11	Delicious and special Bean Mooncake which can increase EXP by 500 points. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
MoonCake12	Delicious and special Red Mooncake which can increase EXP by 2000 points. It's valid until 4:00 pm on 21st.
Chip1	Special item for activities. It can be bought from any Props Merchant. Purchasing Sparta Chips shows your support of Sparta and your belief that it will win the gamble.
Chip2	Special item for activities. It can be bought from any Props Merchant. Purchasing Athens Chips shows your support of Athens and your belief that it will win the gamble.
Oracle1	This is the first oracle from Zeus, which will help you find Europa. Find the next envoy sent by Zeus and obtain the second oracle.
Oracle2	This is the second oracle from Zeus, which will help you find Europa. Find the next envoy sent by Zeus and obtain the third oracle.
Oracle3	This is the third oracle from Zeus, which will help you find Europa. Find the next envoy sent by Zeus and obtain the fourth oracle.
Oracle4	This is the fourth oracle from Zeus, which will help you find Europa. Find the next envoy sent by Zeus and obtain the fifth oracle.
Oracle5	This is the fifth oracle from Zeus, which will help you find Europa. Hurry and help her!
Myscharm	With this scroll, you can visit the Event transporter in the major city and be transported to Sicily at any time(except event time). Completing the quests there will get you lots of talent points.
Nameplate1	It can be claimed from the Faction Crier on Monday and exchanged for rewards. More rewards can be gained if it is first combined with other nameplates.
Nameplate2	It can be claimed from the Faction Crier on Tuesday and exchanged for rewards. More rewards can be gained if it is first combined with other nameplates.
Nameplate3	It can be claimed from the Faction Crier on Wednesday and exchanged for rewards. More rewards can be gained if it is first combined with other nameplates.
Nameplate4	It can be claimed from the Faction Crier on Thursday and exchanged for rewards. More rewards can be gained if it is first combined with other nameplates.
Nameplate5	It can be claimed from the Faction Crier on Friday and exchanged for rewards. More rewards can be gained if it is first combined with other nameplates.
Nameplate6	It can be claimed from the Faction Crier on Saturday and exchanged for rewards. More rewards can be gained if it is first combined with other nameplates.
