Syrinx1	In order to be invited into Pan's Labyrinth, warriors must collect all 6 parts of Pan's invitation from various locations. These parts can be exchanged for the Pan's Invitation Letter (official). |cFF39d8b8 You can make one exhange per day with Pan's Envoy in Treasure Land.|cffffffff
Syrinx2	In order to be invited into Pan's Labyrinth, warriors must collect all 6 parts of Pan's invitation from various locations. These parts can be exchanged for the Pan's Invitation Letter (official). |cFF39d8b8You can claim two invitation parts per week from Pan's Envoy in the Cursed Zone, but the daily limit is claiming one part per day.|cffffffff
Syrinx3	In order to be invited into Pan's Labyrinth, warriors must collect all 6 parts of Pan's invitation from various locations. These parts can be exchanged for the Pan's Invitation Letter (official). |cFF39d8b8 You can make an exhange with Zeus' Envoy 5 at Heara's Labyrinth.|cffffffff
Syrinx4	In order to be invited into Pan's Labyrinth, warriors must collect all 6 parts of Pan's invitation from various locations. These parts can be exchanged for the Pan's Invitation Letter (official). |cFF39d8b8 Everyday, you will receive one on your fifth visit to Sicily.|cffffffff
Syrinx5	In order to be invited into Pan's Labyrinth, warriors must collect all 6 parts of Pan's invitation from various locations. These parts can be exchanged for the Pan's Invitation Letter (official). |cFF39d8b8 You will receive one while claiming you battle rewards.|cffffffff
Syrinx6	In order to be invited into Pan's Labyrinth, warriors must collect all 6 parts of Pan's invitation from various locations. These parts can be exchanged for the Pan's Invitation Letter (official). |cFF39d8b8 You can make one exhange per day with Pan's Envoy in sthe major cities using 400 instance points. |cffffffff
Syrinx7	Only the well traveled will receive Pan's invitation, and with that, an event transporter can transport you to Pan's Labyrinth. |cffF14187The scheduled time is from 12pm to 6pm, Saturdays and Sundays|cffffffff. 
Syrinx8	With this certificate players can redeem precious gifts in Pan's Labyrinth.
Kaddish	These stones can be traded with the God's devoted believers in the suburb for talent points.
Petgift3901	Open it to obtain a male puppet or a female one and some pet food. |cFFF14187Please make sure you have 3 empty slots before opening it.|cffffffff
WHonor3902	Honored to courageous warriors. When used, the heroic reputation will increase by 100 points.
Earphone3919	It is a record of all the most terrifying ghosts of Greece. The Master Ghost Hunter from the main city is interested in obtaining it, because he can exchange it for a magic scroll there.
Earphone3920	The Master Ghost Hunter makes these by hand, however the Master Ghost in the main city doesn't know how, and urgently needs some. Take some to him and you'll receive generous rewards.
Earphone3921	These elaborate gifts are made by named officers, including Nameplate1, Nameplate2, Nameplate3, Nameplate4, Nameplate5 and Nameplate6. Click the right mouse button to use them.|cFFF14187(You must have 6 slots open for the package.)|cffffffff
Earphone3922	Moves a Lvl 10+ character up 2 levels instantly and grants a 2-star cool Item and various other gifts. Starting at Lvl 10, everytime you go up 5 levels you'll get 1 large growth pack until you hit Lvl 50.|cFFF14187(Make sure you have five slots open for the pack)|cffffffff 
Earphone3923	Moves a Lvl 15+ character up 2 levels instantly and grants various gifts.|cFFF14187(Make sure you have five slots open for the pack)|cffffffff 
Earphone3924	Moves a Lvl 20+ character up 2 levels instantly and grants a 2-star cool Item and various other gifts.|cFFF14187(Make sure you have five slots open for the pack)|cffffffff
Earphone3925	Moves a Lvl 25+ character up 2 levels instantly and grants various gifts.|cFFF14187(Make sure you have five slots open for the pack)|cffffffff
Earphone3926	Moves a Lvl 30+ character up 2 levels instantly and grants a 2-star cool Item and various other gifts.|cFFF14187(Make sure you have five slots open for the pack)|cffffffff
Earphone3927	Moves a Lvl 35+ character up 2 levels instantly and grants various gifts.|cFFF14187(Make sure you have five slots open for the pack)|cffffffff
Earphone3928	Moves a Lvl 40+ character up 2 levels instantly and grants a 2-star cool Item and various other gifts.|cFFF14187(Make sure you have five slots open for the pack)|cffffffff 
Earphone3929	Moves a Lvl 45+ character up 2 levels instantly and grants various gifts.|cFFF14187(Make sure you have five slots open for the pack)|cffffffff 
Earphone3930	Moves a Lvl 50+ character up 2 levels instantly and grants a 2-star cool Item and various other gifts.|cFFF14187(Make sure you have five slots open for the pack)|cffffffff
Earphone3931	An insignia awarded to talented adventurer's by the Gods of Olympus. Common gear emblazoned with it can be exchanged with the Gear Enhancement in the main city for a Class Suit. 
Earphone3932	A very precious gem. You can exchange them with the Instance Gatekeeper for additional opportunities to enter the |cFF39d8b8 Atlantis Portal|cffffffff but note that the opportunities won't be available after the second day.
Earphone3933	由黄金制作而成的神秘枫叶，吸收了上古神器的力量，是打造非凡装备的原料。交给主城的圣衣使者就能兑换一个装满经验的圣盒。
Earphone3943	Monsters will drop warriors souls filled with honor this Halloween. Use it to increase honor by 88 points.
Earphone3944	This is given for your recharge during the event as well as your continued support. Click to get 888 Honor points.
Earphone3945	The main course for any traditional Thanksgiving Day feast. The turkeys in the suburbs may drop Savory Turkey Meat when killed. Visit the Thanksgiving Envoy in the main city to exchange [Savory Turkey Meat]*10 for a lot of experience.
Earphone3946	The main course for any traditional Thanksgiving Day feast. The turkeys in the suburbs may drop Tender Turkey Meat when killed. Visit the Thanksgiving Envoy in the main city to exchange [Tender Turkey Meat]*10 for a lot of experience.
Earphone3947	The turkeys in the suburbs may drop a Thanksgiving Gift Certificate when killed. Visit the Thanksgiving Envoy in the main city to exchange [Thanksgiving Gift Certificate]*10 for a ton of bound Gold.
Earphone3948	A gift for VIPs on Thanksgiving Day. Present one Thanksgiving Greetings Card to the Thanksgiving Envoy when exchanging turkey meat or gift certificates you'll get some extra special rewards.
HPPotion_a	Restores HP 200 points.
HPPotion_b	Restores HP 500 points.
HPPotion_c	Restores HP 1000 points.
HPPotion_d	Restores HP 1800 points.
HPPotion_e	A bunch of flowers for mothers, increasing HP by 7000.
HPPotion_x	Restores HP 3000 points.
HPPotion_y	Restores HP 7000 points.
HPPotion_z	Restores 25,000,000 HP points.
MPPotion_a	Restores MP 60 points
MPPotion_b	Restores MP 120 points
MPPotion_c	Restores MP 200 points
MPPotion_d	Restores MP 350 points
MPPotion_x	Restores MP 600 points
MPPotion_y	Restores MP 1000 points
SPPotion_a	The spring was bottled from the Holy Spring on Olympus. It can help the user to regain 20% of their maximum energy. (Also usable while combining with the pet)
SPPotion_b	The spring was got from the Holy Spring on Olympus. It can help the user to regain 45% of their maximum energy. (Also usable while combining with the pet)
SPPotion_c	The spring was got from the Holy Spring on Olympus. It can help the user to regain 95% of their maximum energy. (Also usable while combining with the pet)
GuildStone	The messengers and heralds of the gods at Olympus follow oracles from Zeus and spread his decrees everywhere. The Guild Stone is the symbol of their holy status. With it you can create a guild and be supported by numerous Greek warriors.
Chattool1	The Iris is the flower the goddess of the rainbow likes most. Use it to speak in the world channel. the goddess of the rainbow will help you spread your message.
Storage1	Use it to enlarge warehouse space
Bag1	Use it to enlarge backpack space
AddLevel1	Dionysus was the god of wine. Millet Liqueur is made from grapes near Dionysus's temple. It can increase the user's title by 1 
Ghost1	This is the Warrior's skull, anyone who gets close to it will hear the mighty warrior's roar! The war between Sparta and Athens lasted for hundreds of years and the dead are countless. Now their souls full of anger wander the earth. Put 6 <Forbidden Skulls> on the Compound Interface(shortcut key:D) and it will create a whole <Forbidden Soul>.
Ghost2	This stone is carved with the goddess Elete's mark; which used by the Greeks to hang around their necks during their prayers for peace.The war between Sparta and Athens lasted for hundreds of years and many of these stones became buried in the earth. Put 6 <Live Marks> onto the Compound Interface(shortcut key:D) and a whole will be created <Bliss Light>.
Ghost3	Through the dark mist, some vague souls can be seen covered with blood, waving their arms and shreiking loudly. If you have a <Bliss Light> in your bag, you can gather many gems or crystals automatically by also using the <Forbidden Soul>.
Ghost4	This shining ball is marked with the Goddess Elete's bliss. It has the power to release the wandering souls from their purgatory on the battlefield. If you have a <Bliss Light> in your bag, you can gather many gems or crystals automatically when you also use the <Forbidden Soul>.
AddPetNum	Use as an extra shed in which to keep a pet.
ChatBubble1	Do you want to have a red chatbubble for 3 hours? It's special for Greek nobles.
ChatBubble2	Do you want to have a blue chatbubble for 3 hours? It's special for Greek nobles.
PetName	Use it to rename your pet.
PetQuest	A bell filled with magical power. When shaken, you can command your pet to do a certain |cFF39d8b8 Daily Quest|cFFFFFFFF. Just unfold the |cFF39d8b8 Quest Log (Shortcut Key: Q)|cFFFFFFFF and then click |cFF39d8b8[Send Pet]|cFFFFFFFF to use the bell
Chattool2	It helps players spread their words throughout the world. Click it and send out your words and emotions.
AstrictPK1	It can protect users from PK damage for one hour. The user cannot hurt others either.
HideCamp1	Wear it to become a Green Name for 30 minutes. Players will mistake you for their companion.
HideID1	Artemis is the patron of wild animals. The cypress leaves blessed by her help animals get away from being trapped by hunters. After using Cypress Leaves, your name will be displayed as a Masked Man for 2 hours. Nearby players will not see your face clearly.
Money1	Open it to obtain 10,000 Silver.
Money2	Open it to obtain 100,000 Silver.
Money3	Open it to obtain 500,000 Silver.
Money4	Open it to obtain numerous silver
Stone1	Open it to obtain a litte gold
Stone2	Open it to obtain some gold
Stone3	Open it to obtain much gold
Stone4	Open it to obtain numerous gold
Stone5	Use it to obtain 2009 E-Gold.
Stone6	Open it to obtain some E-Gold.
