AddEXP2	Hermes carved the fast growth technique on the stone. Use it to obtain 5000 Exp.
AddEXP3	Hermes carved the fast growth technique on the stone. Use it to obtain 10000 Exp.
AddEXP4	Hermes carved the fast growth technique on the stone. Use it to obtain 30000 Exp.
