MaterialID1	Fragmented Level 1 Ruby with weak energy. It can increase gear's level.
MaterialID2	Rough Level 2 Ruby with some energy. It can increase gear's level.
MaterialID3	Delicate Level 3 Ruby with much energy. It can increase gear's level.
MaterialBase1	Fragmented Level 1 Sapphire with weak energy. It can increase gear's quality.
MaterialBase2	Rough Level 2 Sapphire with some energy. It can increase gear's quality.
MaterialBase3	Delicate Level 3 Sapphire with much energy. It can increase gear's quality.
MaterialAppend1	Fragmented Level 1 Emerald with weak energy. It can increase gear's grade.
MaterialAppend2	Rough Level 2 Emerald with some energy. It can increase gear's grade.
MaterialAppend3	Delicate Level 3 Emerald with much energy. It can increase gear's grade.
MaterialOdds1	Flawed Level 1 Crystal with weak energy. It can increase the success rate of forging gear a bit.
MaterialOdds2	Pretty complete Level 2 Crystal with some energy. It can increase the success rate of forging gear much more.
MaterialOdds3	Stainless Level 3 Crystal with endless energy. It can increase the success rate of forging gear greatly.
MaterialFlee1	Unknown copper coin with yellow light. It can protect participating gear from suffering any damage
MaterialFlee2	Silver coin with weak light. It can protect participating gear from suffering any damage.
MaterialFlee3	Lucky gold coin with shining light. It can protect participating gear from suffering any damage
Material4250	Collect 6 Level 1 Amethyst fragments to compound them into a Level 2 Amethyst.
Material4251	Collect 6 rough Level 2 Amethysts to compound them into a Level 3 Amethyst.
Material4252	Level 3 Amethyst transforms one gear piece into another gear piece of the same type with a random rank.It can also switch armor between physical defense or magical defense.
Copperstone	Produced on the Isle of Cyprus and in wide use militarily. Greek cities who are short on copper ore must purchase them.
Ironstone	Produced from Skyros and used for making advanced weapons and armor. In Greece, iron ore is considered a very important battle resource.
Foodsupplies	War Material 1, can be exchanged for rewards at Quartermasters. |cFFF14187War Materials can be bought from the Item Mall or obtained through guild quests. At most 6 War Materials can be turned in per day.|cffffffff.
