EXPGet1	An elixir of the Olympian Gods, increasing Exp gained by 25% for 15 min.
EXPGet2	An elixir of the Olympian Gods, increasing Exp gained by 50% for 1 hour.
EXPGet3	An elixir of the Olympian Gods, increasing Exp gained by 100% for 1 hour.
EXPGet4	An elixir of the Olympian Gods, increasing Exp gained to 400% for 1 hour. 
EXPGet4504	For two hours, experience gain will increase by 100%.
EXPGet4505	For one hour, physical and magic attacks will increase damage by 10%.
EXPGet4506	This extended release EXP potion allows an 8 hour period of double EXP from monster-kills.
EXPGet4507	Candy for Halloween! Eating Pumpkin Candy gives you an additional 10% Exp bonus for 30 minutes or you can exchange it for other rewards by visiting the Halloween Envoy in the main city.
AutoItem1	Made of the blood of wrathful lions, it restores 500 HP points per sec for 30 sec.
AutoItem2	Made of the blood of ancient beasts, it restores 100 HP points per sec for 1 hour.
AutoItem4512	Made of the magical blood of ancient demons, it restores 5 MP points per sec for 1 hour.
AutoItem3	Increases output damage by 30% for 1 minute.
AutoItem4	Essence extracted from monsters. It can be exchanged for strong force or Holy Water.
AutoItem5	Obtain 30 points by dedicating it to the Gods at players' own altar, and 100 points for turning it in at a hostile altar.
