Suitpt	It's an ordinary equipment, and no where on this will you find a trace of Holy Suit. |cFFF14187"Suit effect is increased as the points are increased."|cffffffff
Suitqt1	It's dilapidated, and if it was for the few bronze plates still intact, I wouldn't be able to tell this was once a Bronze Holy Suit. |cFFF14187"Suit effect is increased as the points are increased."|cffffffff
Suitqt2	Instantly, one can spot this Bronze Holy Suit, but it is quite weathered and it should be repaired to store full strength. |cFFF14187"Suit effect is increased as the points are increased."|cffffffff 
Suitqt3	Everything tells me this is a beautiful Bronze Holy Suit, and even though it isn't perfect, it doesn't have to be. |cFFF14187"Suit effect is increased as the points are increased."|cffffffff
Suitqt4	Flawless! You have to wonder how this Bronze Holy Suit was created for us. |cFFF14187"Suit effect is increased as the points are increased."|cffffffff
